{"title":"Categoria:Creatures","sourceTitle":"Category:Creatures/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Category:Creatures\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Category:Creatures (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Creatures/es\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Categoría:Criaturas (77% translated)\" lang=\"es\" dir=\"ltr\">español</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Creatures/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Category:Créatures (77% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Creatures/pl\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Kategoria: Stworzenia (97% translated)\" lang=\"pl\" dir=\"ltr\">polski</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Creatures/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Существа (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Creatures/uk\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--high\" title=\"Категорія: Істоти (77% translated)\" lang=\"uk\" dir=\"ltr\">українська</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Category:Creatures/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"分类：生物 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<p>Uma grande variedade de <b>criaturas</b> habitam os mundos serenos de Vintage Story, aqui estão algumas das mais comumente encontradas. Veja <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Animal_Husbandry\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Animal Husbandry\">Animal Husbandry</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Animal_Husbandry\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Animal Husbandry\"> </a></span> para informações sobre domesticação e criação de animais.\n</p><p><span id=\"Naturally&#95;Spawning\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gerando_naturalmente\">Gerando naturalmente</span></h3>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Imagem</th>\n<th>Nome</th>\n<th>Agressão</th>\n<th>Habitat / Desova</th>\n<th>Comportamento\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Bowtorn-surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/6/68/Bowtorn-surface.png/71px-Bowtorn-surface.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"71\" height=\"71\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/68/Bowtorn-surface.png/107px-Bowtorn-surface.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/68/Bowtorn-surface.png/142px-Bowtorn-surface.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bowtorn/draft\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bowtorn/draft\">Bowtorn</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bowtorn/draft\" title=\"Bowtorn/draft\"> </a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Hostil\n</td>\n<td>Em qualquer lugar, mas com dificuldade de aumentar com a profundidade\n</td>\n<td>Eles caminham entre árvores ou outros obstáculos e atiram dardos mortais no jogador. Eles fogem se o jogador chegar muito perto\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Shiver-surface.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/5/56/Shiver-surface.png/71px-Shiver-surface.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"71\" height=\"71\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/5/56/Shiver-surface.png/107px-Shiver-surface.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/5/56/Shiver-surface.png/142px-Shiver-surface.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Shiver/draft\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Shiver/draft\">Arrepio</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Shiver/draft\" title=\"Shiver/draft\"> </a></span>\n</td>\n<td>Hostil\n</td>\n<td>Em qualquer lugar, mas com dificuldade de aumentar com a profundidade\n</td>\n<td>Rastejando no chão, fazendo barulhos estranhos\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Normal_Drifter.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/14/Normal_Drifter.png/80px-Normal_Drifter.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/14/Normal_Drifter.png/120px-Normal_Drifter.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/14/Normal_Drifter.png/160px-Normal_Drifter.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Drifter\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Drifter\">Vagante</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Drifter\" title=\"Drifter\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Hostil</td>\n<td>Em qualquer lugar, mas com dificuldade de aumentar com a profundidade</td>\n<td>Desova no escuro e vai embora durante o dia.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Locust.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/1e/Locust.png/71px-Locust.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"71\" height=\"71\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/1e/Locust.png/107px-Locust.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/1e/Locust.png/142px-Locust.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Locust\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Locust\">Locuste</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Locust\" title=\"Locust\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Hostil</td>\n<td>Ninhos de gafanhotos em cavernas</td>\n<td>Encontrado em grandes grupos. Sempre ataca em grupos.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Creature-bell-normal.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/e/ed/Creature-bell-normal.png/80px-Creature-bell-normal.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/e/ed/Creature-bell-normal.png/120px-Creature-bell-normal.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/e/ed/Creature-bell-normal.png/160px-Creature-bell-normal.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bell\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bell\">Sino</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bell\" title=\"Bell\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Hostil</td>\n<td>Em qualquer lugar nas cavernas</td>\n<td>Começa a tocar sozinho e convoca vagabundos próximos se o jogador chegar muito perto.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Creature-wolf-male.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/b/b8/Creature-wolf-male.png/80px-Creature-wolf-male.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/b/b8/Creature-wolf-male.png/120px-Creature-wolf-male.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/b/b8/Creature-wolf-male.png/160px-Creature-wolf-male.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Wolf\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Wolf\">Lobo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Hostil</td>\n<td>Climas frios</td>\n<td>Geralmente encontrado em grupos. Procura e caça ativamente o jogador.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:BeeMob.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/0/0d/BeeMob.png/80px-BeeMob.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/0d/BeeMob.png/120px-BeeMob.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/0d/BeeMob.png/160px-BeeMob.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"504\" data-file-height=\"438\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bees\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bees\">Abelhas</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bees\" title=\"Bees\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Hostil</td>\n<td>Climas quentes</td>\n<td>Aparece apenas ao quebrar uma colmeia ou ao lançar pedras. Ataque qualquer entidade próxima, até mesmo bonecos de palha. As abelhas não podem ser mortas, mas desaparecem após 2 minutos.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Creature-sheep-bighorn-male.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/f/f6/Creature-sheep-bighorn-male.png/80px-Creature-sheep-bighorn-male.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f6/Creature-sheep-bighorn-male.png/120px-Creature-sheep-bighorn-male.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f6/Creature-sheep-bighorn-male.png/160px-Creature-sheep-bighorn-male.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bighorn_sheep\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bighorn sheep\">Carneiro selvagem</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bighorn_sheep\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bighorn sheep\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Neutra</td>\n<td>Clima temperado e frio</td>\n<td>Geralmente encontrado em grupos. Ataca apenas quando provocado ou quando o jogador está muito próximo.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Wild_pig(Male).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/2/20/Wild_pig%28Male%29.png/80px-Wild_pig%28Male%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/2/20/Wild_pig%28Male%29.png/120px-Wild_pig%28Male%29.png 1.5x, /images/2/20/Wild_pig%28Male%29.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Wild_Pig\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Wild Pig\">Porco selvagem</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Wild_Pig\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wild Pig\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Neutra</td>\n<td>Climas temperados</td>\n<td>Geralmente encontrado em grupos. Ataca apenas quando provocado.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Chicken(Male).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/3/37/Chicken%28Male%29.png/80px-Chicken%28Male%29.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/37/Chicken%28Male%29.png/120px-Chicken%28Male%29.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/37/Chicken%28Male%29.png/160px-Chicken%28Male%29.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Chicken\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Chicken\">Galinha</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Chicken\" title=\"Chicken\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Passivo</td>\n<td>Climas temperados e quentes</td>\n<td>Geralmente encontrado em grupos. Fuja do jogador, os galos ocasionalmente revidam.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Creature-fox-male.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/d/dd/Creature-fox-male.png/80px-Creature-fox-male.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/d/dd/Creature-fox-male.png/120px-Creature-fox-male.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/d/dd/Creature-fox-male.png/160px-Creature-fox-male.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fox\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fox\">Raposa</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fox\" title=\"Fox\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Neutra</td>\n<td>Climas temperados</td>\n<td>Geralmente encontrado em pequenos grupos. Ataca apenas quando provocado.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Raccoon.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/7/7c/Raccoon.png/80px-Raccoon.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/7c/Raccoon.png/120px-Raccoon.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/7c/Raccoon.png/160px-Raccoon.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Raccoon\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Raccoon\">Guaxinim</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Raccoon\" title=\"Raccoon\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Neutra</td>\n<td>Climas temperados</td>\n<td>Come frutas vermelhas e mel. Corre do jogador, mas pode atacar se for danificado.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Creature-hyena-male.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/6/62/Creature-hyena-male.png/80px-Creature-hyena-male.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/6/62/Creature-hyena-male.png/120px-Creature-hyena-male.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/6/62/Creature-hyena-male.png/160px-Creature-hyena-male.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hyena\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hyena\">Hiena</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hyena\" title=\"Hyena\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Hostil</td>\n<td>Climas quentes e secos</td>\n<td>Semelhante aos lobos, mas em climas secos.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Hare-male-lightbrown.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/9/9e/Hare-male-lightbrown.png/80px-Hare-male-lightbrown.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/9/9e/Hare-male-lightbrown.png/120px-Hare-male-lightbrown.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/9/9e/Hare-male-lightbrown.png/160px-Hare-male-lightbrown.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Hare\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Hare\">Lebre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Hare\" title=\"Hare\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Passivo</td>\n<td>Climas temperados</td>\n<td>Coma plantas cultivadas pelo jogador se não houver cerca para protegê-las. Fuja do jogador.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Bear-male-brown.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/f/fc/Bear-male-brown.png/80px-Bear-male-brown.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/fc/Bear-male-brown.png/120px-Bear-male-brown.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/fc/Bear-male-brown.png/160px-Bear-male-brown.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Bear\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Bear\">Urso</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Bear\" title=\"Bear\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Hostil</td>\n<td>A maioria dos climas</td>\n<td>Procura e caça ativamente o jogador.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Creature-gazelle-male.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/14/Creature-gazelle-male.png/80px-Creature-gazelle-male.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/14/Creature-gazelle-male.png/120px-Creature-gazelle-male.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/14/Creature-gazelle-male.png/160px-Creature-gazelle-male.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Gazelle\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Gazelle\">Gazela</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Gazelle\" title=\"Gazelle\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Passivo</td>\n<td>Climas secos</td>\n<td>Aparece em grupos e foge do jogador.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Goat-nubian-female-adult.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/3/37/Goat-nubian-female-adult.png/80px-Goat-nubian-female-adult.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/3/37/Goat-nubian-female-adult.png/120px-Goat-nubian-female-adult.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/3/37/Goat-nubian-female-adult.png/160px-Goat-nubian-female-adult.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Goat\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Goat\">Cabra</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Goat\" title=\"Goat\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Passivo</td>\n<td>Muitos climas (ver página Cabra)</td>\n<td>Aparece em grupos e foge do jogador.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Deer-whitetail-male-adult.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/0/0b/Deer-whitetail-male-adult.png/80px-Deer-whitetail-male-adult.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/0/0b/Deer-whitetail-male-adult.png/120px-Deer-whitetail-male-adult.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/0/0b/Deer-whitetail-male-adult.png/160px-Deer-whitetail-male-adult.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Deer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Deer\">Veado</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Deer\" title=\"Deer\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Passivo</td>\n<td>Muitos climas (veja a página Deer)</td>\n<td>Aparece em grupos e foge do jogador.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Termites.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/f/f7/Termites.png/80px-Termites.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/f/f7/Termites.png/120px-Termites.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/f/f7/Termites.png/160px-Termites.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Termite\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Termite\">Cupins</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Termite\" title=\"Termite\"> </a></span></td>\n<td>Passivo</td>\n<td>Climas quentes e secos</td>\n<td>Insetos escondidos em cupinzeiros. Quebre os cupinzeiros para pegar e comer os cupins. Totalmente inofensivo.\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><span id=\"Purchasing\"></span>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Compra\">Compra</span></h3>\n<p>Você pode comprar um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Wolf\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Wolf\">wolf pup</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Wolf\" title=\"Wolf\"> </a></span> em uma gaiola de um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading#Survival_Goods\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">Survival Goods Trader</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading#Survival_Goods\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span> por um preço médio de 8 <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/rusty_gear\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/rusty gear\">rusty gears</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rusty_gear\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Rusty gear\"> </a></span>. O filhote é selvagem. Se você soltá-lo, ele fugirá e se transformará em um lobo selvagem depois de algum tempo.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Navegação Wiki</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>História antiga</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Special:MyLanguag